    <title>S1E26 学术圈就像阿修罗道：直播回答了六百个留学读硕博的问题之后 | 险远篇01</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae00844c96c8942ec12c418</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae00844c96c8942ec12c418</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑假两个月，23 场直播，我听见无数名校学子的焦虑：压榨的导师、无尽的同辈对比、无声笼罩的父母期待、不敢直视的自我。硕博师徒制早已卡在古典模式和规模化培养的夹缝里，压力层层落到学生身上。求学没有标准答案，best or nothing 本就是陷阱。年轻人还有机会，慢慢看清体系，也看清自己。</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【本期成员】</span></em></strong></p><p><span>玉肃：中登副教授，莫名其妙地成了学生们的情绪垃圾场</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【时间轴】</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> “有毒”的导师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">7:08</a> 缺失却又始终笼罩的父母</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">9:05</a>同辈压力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 不愿直视的自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 结语</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【关于频道】</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span>自救事务所</span></strong><span>是一档探讨我们当下困境的播客，专注于分析困境，分享经验。</span></p><p><span>更多内容请关注 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/642b6e0e0000000011020055?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=642b6e0e0000000011020055&amp;apptime=1724813917&amp;share_id=2387a286c6b043babb4d4a60193eb3bb" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/642b6e0e0000000011020055?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=642b6e0e0000000011020055&amp;apptime=1724813917&amp;share_id=2387a286c6b043babb4d4a60193eb3bb"><span>玉肃的小红书</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://b23.tv/tIxLupj" data-url="https://b23.tv/tIxLupj"><span>B站</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAArTj2aNPwmlFyfB7Pm8GbVJdobU5AFN6GRFYMNT1cY9vUT2-LLyQu0lupVDt-cJwA" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAArTj2aNPwmlFyfB7Pm8GbVJdobU5AFN6GRFYMNT1cY9vUT2-LLyQu0lupVDt-cJwA"><span>抖音</span></a></p><p><span>微信公众号：一苇行</span></p><p><span>联系方式：socialgingercat@gmail.com或者小红书/B站私信。</span></p><p><span>临安计划：玉肃 Yu Su</span></p>]]></description>
