  <item>
    <title>S1E23 被博士导师劝退了怎么办？|学业困境12</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698a81ab66e2c30377b8626c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698a81ab66e2c30377b8626c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 00:57:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和一位博三同学的对谈。她正面临棘手困境：读博两年间多次被导师劝退，导师既给出转组、转学等选项，又对她的科研进度不满，而她自己不仅要应对繁重的课程与科研任务，撰写的论文，也未得到导师充分指导，同时纠结于与导师的关系处理和推荐信问题。</span></p><p><span>我帮她理清了问题的核心：导师实则是想结束合作，并非她不够优秀，且转学对导师无实质伤害，无需背负道德负担；不建议使用原导师推荐信，可选择任课老师等利益不相关者作为推荐人；还给出具体方向，比如整理现有科研成果（包括未发表和被拒的论文）完善申请材料，套词被拒无需介怀，应持续尝试。</span></p><p><span>为保护提问同学的隐私，她的声音用 AI 做了处理。</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【本期成员】</span></em></strong></p><p><span>嘉宾：匿名同学，博三</span></p><p><span>主播：玉肃，美国工科副教授</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【时间轴】</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 被导师劝退了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">03:41</a> 科研进展与内心顾虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> 潜在原因与过往冲突复盘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 转学建议与现实阻碍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 具体行动指南与心态调整</span></p><p><strong><em><span>【关于频道】</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span>自救事务所</span></strong><span>是一档探讨我们当下困境的播客，专注于分析困境，分享经验。</span></p><p><span>更多内容请关注 玉肃的</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/642b6e0e0000000011020055?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=642b6e0e0000000011020055&amp;apptime=1724813917&amp;share_id=2387a286c6b043babb4d4a60193eb3bb" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/642b6e0e0000000011020055?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=642b6e0e0000000011020055&amp;apptime=1724813917&amp;share_id=2387a286c6b043babb4d4a60193eb3bb"><span>小红书</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://b23.tv/tIxLupj" data-url="https://b23.tv/tIxLupj"><span>B站</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAArTj2aNPwmlFyfB7Pm8GbVJdobU5AFN6GRFYMNT1cY9vUT2-LLyQu0lupVDt-cJwA" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAArTj2aNPwmlFyfB7Pm8GbVJdobU5AFN6GRFYMNT1cY9vUT2-LLyQu0lupVDt-cJwA"><span>抖音</span></a></p><p><span>微信公众号：一苇行</span></p><p><span>联系方式：socialgingercat@gmail.com或者小红书/B站私信。</span></p><p><span>临安计划：玉肃 Yu Su</spa